                            fragmentPath="/content/dam/weekender-shared/en/adventures/west-coast-cycling/west-coast-cycling"
                            paragraphScope="all"
                            text="West Coast Cycling The road north from San Francisco follows the Pacific for most of a thousand kilometres. We ride the best of it in five stages of 70 to 100 kilometres, and a van carries bikes and riders over the stretches in between. Expect steady climbs, ocean wind and a clam chowder at the end of each day."
